Note on artwork / 关于素材

The MIT license above covers the **code** in this repository.

The images under `assets/` are fan artwork collected from public image boards
and are **not** covered by this license. "Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba" and
its characters are the property of their respective rights holders; this is an
unofficial, non-commercial fan skin. If you are a rights holder and want an
image removed, open an issue and it will be taken down.

`assets/` 下的图片是从公开图站收集的同人图，**不在** MIT 授权范围内。
《鬼灭之刃》及其角色版权归原作者与权利方所有；本项目是非官方、非营利的同人皮肤。
权利方如要求下架某张图，开 issue 即可，会立刻移除。
